OL,3,ANetanyahu says pilot arrested after
OL,4,Astabbing another pilot and apparently
OL,5,Atrying to crash Israel-bound plane
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pilot on an Israel-bound flight
OL,8,Fstabbed another pilot and "apparently
OL,9,Ftried to crash the plane", says Israeli
OL,10,FPM Benjamin Netanyahu
OL,12,FThe plane was travelling from Dubai to
OL,13,FTel Aviv when it plummeted 17,000ft
OL,14,F(5,200m) in less than two minutes,
OL,15,Fbefore being diverted to Saudi Arabia
OL,17,FOne passenger reports "terrible screams
OL,18,Fthroughout the plane" before "three to
OL,19,Ffive guys burst into the cockpit" and
OL,20,Fsubdued an attacker
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
